{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of a <strong>museum tycoon</strong> in this hands-on preview of <strong>Museum Magnate</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you\u2019ll get an early taste of the core gameplay: from building the foundation of your museum to uncovering rare artifacts through the excavation minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664340/extras/exhibit.png?t=1745700129\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Museum Magnate</strong> is a <strong>3D museum tycoon game</strong> which gives you all the freedom you would expect from a tycoon game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664340/extras/explore.png?t=1745700129\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design engaging exhibits, hire your first staff members, and start managing your resources to keep your guests intrigued and your halls bustling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664340/extras/collect.png?t=1745700129\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're strategizing your next expansion or getting your hands dirty in the field, this demo offers a glimpse into the exciting journey of becoming the ultimate Museum Magnate.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664340?t=1745700129","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664340?t=1745700129","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664340/ea53192e25f57bc5d88f3ddcfbc334c51088f9f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745700129","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664340/ea53192e25f57bc5d88f3ddcfbc334c51088f9f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745700129","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of a <strong>museum tycoon</strong> in this hands-on preview of <strong>Museum Magnate</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you\u2019ll get an early taste of the core gameplay: from building the foundation of your museum to uncovering rare artifacts through the excavation minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664340/extras/exhibit.png?t=1745700129\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Museum Magnate</strong> is a <strong>3D museum tycoon game</strong> which gives you all the freedom you would expect from a tycoon game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664340/extras/explore.png?t=1745700129\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design engaging exhibits, hire your first staff members, and start managing your resources to keep your guests intrigued and your halls bustling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664340/extras/collect.png?t=1745700129\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're strategizing your next expansion or getting your hands dirty in the field, this demo offers a glimpse into the exciting journey of becoming the ultimate Museum Magnate.</p>","developers":["Three Dragons s.r.o."],"fullgame":{"appid":"3621210","name":"Museum Magnate"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset